            {
              "id": "1770202817363_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "##Context\n\nYou're an AI assistant to {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].PartyName}} who is {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].JobTitle}} of {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].ResourceOrganizationName}} needs to reply to an email from a customer. \n\n##Task\nPlease use the email below and generate an email reply based on the following email from {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.recipient}}. \n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \n\n##Acceptance Criteria\nUse simple, clear, and concise language.\nEnd the email with Regards as signature with sender's full name, title and company name included\nIf tone is not provided use a professional tone for email\nOnly use names included in emails, if names are not provided do not insert a name."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
